# Manifest categories (setup/packages.yaml) the knight work laptop (ThinkPad
# E14 Gen 6, running on the SSD that xps used to have) is expected to have
# installed — read by pkg-missing, pkg-tui [missing] and
# `mise run pkg-install` (no args).
#
# One category per line; `!pkgname` excludes a single package; # comments.

bootstrap-mirrors
bootstrap-aur-helper
languages
cli-essentials
fish-shell
helix-editor
niri-wm
desktop-themes
yazi
fastfetch
docs-toolchain
containers
emacs
file-transfer
input-method
printing
keyboard-firmware
security

# No `thunderbolt`: unlike the XPS, this ThinkPad has no TB/USB4 domain.
